<hdoc>
  <header>
    <h1>Broken XML
  </header>
  <content>
    <p>The header above is missing its closing h1 tag. HDOCParser regex-extracts and
    strips &lt;content&gt; before XML-parsing the remaining skeleton, so this file is
    deliberately broken outside of &lt;content&gt; to actually reach the DOMParser and
    trigger a &lt;parsererror&gt;.</p>
  </content>
</hdoc>
